# GitHub reports languages by bytes of code, and the vendored tree-sitter
# grammars carry ~41 MB of machine-generated parser tables — one of them,
# TreeSitterSqlVendored/src/parser.c, is 39.7 MB on its own. That made the
# repository look like 97.7% C when no C is written for this app at all.

# Third-party grammars, vendored wholesale.
TreeSitterSqlVendored/**   linguist-vendored
TreeSitterYAMLVendored/**  linguist-vendored
TreeSitterDiffVendored/**  linguist-vendored

# Our own grammar: the parser tables are generated, but grammar.js and the
# queries are hand-written and should still count.
TreeSitterBestTextLog/src/parser.c      linguist-generated
TreeSitterBestTextLog/src/grammar.json  linguist-generated
TreeSitterBestTextLog/src/node-types.json linguist-generated
